  crates/rusty-libc-regex    parse, nfa, exec, collation contractions, step/advance
  crates/rusty-libc-net      inet, ns_* and dn_* functions, res_debug, netgroups, rcmd, getaddrinfo_a
  crates/rusty-libc-fortify  the _chk functions and abort messages
  crates/rusty-libc-stdio    translit.rs (C-locale transliteration table), printf extension registry, ftw
  crates/rusty-libc-iconv    charset, composition, CJK and transliteration tables, gconv layouts
  crates/rusty-libc-ipc      aio, mq, notify
  crates/rusty-libc-extra    ftw/nftw, argp, spawn-related code, ttyent, fstab and related files
  crates/rusty-libc-locale   archive reader, category loader, collation, gettext, catgets, grouping
  crates/rusty-libc-wchar    Charset::Other, wide-character tables
  crates/rusty-libc-rpc      Sun RPC and XDR (see entry 2)
  crates/rusty-libc-sys      legacy-versioned cfget/cfset speed functions
  crates/rusty-libc-core     NSS plug-in loading and enumeration (nssmod), netgroup and alias parsing layout
  crates/rusty-libc-time     strftime.rs (and wcsftime in rusty-libc-wchar wtime.rs)
  crates/rusty-libc-ctype    __ctype32_* tables (data measured from glibc)
  crates/rusty-libc-ldso     glibc elf/ and sprof behaviour read as reference (no code carried over)
  crates/rusty-libc-cabi     compatibility symbol shims for old symbol versions
