10. Published algorithms and facts (no notice required)
-------------------------------------------------------
Eisel-Lemire fast path (D. Lemire, 2021), Borges (2019) hypot, Joldes-Muller-
Popescu double-double arithmetic, Chebyshev and Taylor tables generated by
the scripts in crates/rusty-libc-math, ABI constants (limits, errno, socket
and ioctl numbers, struct layouts), and character set mappings probed from
the reference system. Third-party libraries are not included.
